# nss-mdns, toolchain llvm
### --undefined-version: the one version script of the six modules names the functions of all of them
### (_nss_mdns4_*, _nss_mdns6_minimal_*...), and each module defines its own. GNU ld passes over an
### assignment to a symbol it does not have, lld makes it an error since 17
PKG_LDFLAGS="-Wl,--undefined-version"
